2. There shall be payable to the Director-General of Customs the following fees for every declaration required by the Customs Act (Cap. 70) for the import, export or transhipment of goods:
(a)$0.90 per declaration made before 19th December 2012 by electronic notice through TradeNet solely for the purposes of that Act;
(b)$10 per declaration made not using TradeNet before 19th December 2012 solely for the purposes of that Act.
